{"id":"00023","root":"uni00023_1","name":{"ja":"ミナサキ","en":"Minasaki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ミナサキ","en":"Minasaki"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":23,"profile":{"ja":"ヤタガラスの化身を名乗る少女。背中には黒い鳥の羽が生えていて一見すると堕天使のようにも見える。少し独占欲が強く、気に入ったものは自分のものにしたがる。お気に入りを奪おうとする人物はだれであろうと許さず、全力で排除しようとする。それ以外の人物には寛容で、敵にまわりさえしなければ特に自分から何かしようとはしない。一人称が「ボク」なボクっ娘。少し気分屋なところがあり、突然作業を止めたり、別のことをし始めたりする時がある。仲間のリリムとはいたずら仲間である。","en":"Minasaki claims to be the incarnation of a night raven. Black feathers sprout from her back, giving her an almost fallen-angel appearance. She has a strong streak of possessiveness, insisting that anything she likes becomes hers. She won't tolerate anyone trying to take her favorites, no matter who they are, and will eliminate them at all costs. With everyone else she's tolerant, and as long as they don't become enemies she won't act on her own initiative. She refers to herself as \"Boku,\" a classic \"boku-girl.\" Her mood can swing quickly, sometimes halting a task abruptly to start something else. She and Lilim are mischievous partners in crime."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"葉月まぁち","forms":[{"id":"uni00023_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2072],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[128,257],"def":[116,234],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","65"]},{"id":"uni00023_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1572,3145],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[191,382],"def":[167,335],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","65","66"]},{"id":"uni00023_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2108,4216],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[259,519],"def":[223,446],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","65","66"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage"}]},"65":{"slot":"skill1","id":65,"name":{"ja":"羽演"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 285% Spiritual damage"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -15% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down"}]},"66":{"slot":"skill2","id":66,"name":{"ja":"侵略者への断罪"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":2,"sp":245,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":3,"sp":240,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":4,"sp":235,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のATKを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"ヤタガラス"},"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ユニットのSPDを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Spiritual allies: SPD +20%","icon":"spd_up"}]},"abilities":[],"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「ボク、ミナサキって言うんだ。一緒に遊んでよ♪」","en":"I'm Minasaki. Play with me♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ねえねえ、これから何するの？　ボク暇なんだ。遊ぼうよ♪","en":"Hey hey, what are we doing now? I'm bored. Let's have fun♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"あ～、もう飽きたよ～！　ねえなんか面白いことしようよぉ！","en":"Ah~ I'm already bored~! Hey, let's do something fun!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"へへ～、これからリリムちゃんと遊ぶんだ♪　一緒に来る？","en":"Hehe~, I'm going to play with Lilim-chan now♪ Want to come along?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"これ、ボクの宝物なんだ♪　欲しがっても絶対あげないからね♪","en":"This is my treasure♪ Even if you want it, I'll never give it to you♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ふっふっふ……これをこうして置けば……ひゃあっ！？　べ、別にイタズラの準備なんてしてないよ！？","en":"Fufufu… if I place this like this… Hyaa!? N-no, I'm not planning any prank!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"僕はミナサキ！　ヤタガラスの化身なんだ！　すごいでしょ！","en":"I'm Minasaki! I'm the incarnation of a night raven! Amazing, right?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"僕のハッピートレーサーに見つけられない相手はいないよ♪","en":"No one can escape my Happy Tracer♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00023_1/uni00023_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2